            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I was just wondering about this same. Here are some additional options to consider:\r\n> \r\n>     * Upwork\r\n> \r\n>     * Patreon\r\n> \r\n>     * Paypal\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> I am willing to support you too! Mini is the best set of plugins for neovim\r\n\r\nThank you **so** much for your enthusiasm!\r\n\r\nI looked into all of these. My main concern is that sponsoring should be made as easy for givers as it gets. All of these do not seem *yet* to be as convenient as GitHub sponsors. I'll probably figure something out :)",
