        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "A bit short of two years, but yeah :(\n\nI *am* looking for appropriate ways to resolve this. Unfortunately, there are not only ideological but also real life personal issues that make this harder than it needs to be.\n\nThe move to the GitHub organization (from the personal account) was towards that direction. As mentioned in #1970, it opens up possibilities to set up financial support for the MINI open source project (instead of personal donations).\n\nSubscribing to this issue became my goto way of suggesting people to get notified if/when there is a way to sponsor the project. You already helped by creating this, so please let's move that bit of a weight from your conscience :) You'll be the first to know if anything changes in this regard.",
